.Sh NAME
.Nm true
.Nd do nothing, successfully
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar ignored ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
does nothing and exits 0.
Its arguments are ignored.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Nm
exits 0.
.Sh EXAMPLES
Loop until interrupted:
.Dl while true; do date; sleep 60; done
